      ["Host", "the AI app in front of you: a chat app, an IDE, an agent"],
      ["Server", "a small program that offers tools, data or prompts"],
      ["Model", "chooses what to use; it never reaches a server itself"],
      ["Not REST", "JSON-RPC over stdin/stdout or a single HTTP endpoint, both ways"],
      ["Not just JSON-RPC", "JSON-RPC is the envelope; MCP adds methods, handshake, transports and auth"]
